Got you, Dom. Since you're just starting and aiming to grow your music brand on TikTok with a unique sound (J Dilla/Monte Booker vibe + dub/jungle elements + Ivy Lab-style polish), here’s a **complete foundational branding guide** built for long-term growth, artist credibility, and viral potential:

