  Notable For: Mesh Korea, a logistics and last-mile delivery startup leveraging AI to improve efficiency in South Korea’s delivery infrastructure.  
  Why Watch: Choi is capitalizing on South Korea's strong e-commerce and tech-driven culture, making waves in logistics and urban mobility.

---

## Conclusion  
This list represents a growing wave of young innovators emerging from countries outside the traditional U.S.-centric tech space. While Silicon Valley and the U.S. still dominate the conversation, the innovation landscape is becoming far more global. With advances in AI, blockchain, fintech, sustainability, and digital transformation, many of these figures are poised to shape the future of tech across the globe.  
Keep an eye on these folks in the coming years—they could very well be the ones leading the next wave of global innovation!
