Many high performers maintain their mental energy largely because they maintain their physical systems.

### 5. The Network Flywheel  
The most overlooked advantage during this phase is who you interact with regularly.  

Many opportunities come from collaborators, peers, and communities.  

This doesn’t have to mean aggressive networking.  

